The scene engine under src/flex/ is a TypeScript translation of FlexDMD's C#
implementation (FlexDMD/Actors/, FlexDMD/BMFonts/, FlexDMD/AssetManager.cs,
FlexDMD/BitmapFilter.cs, FlexDMD/FlexDMD.cs and FlexDMD/Glide/Ease.cs). Those
files have been modified from the originals: they were rewritten in TypeScript
to render to an HTML canvas, and they record the source positions of script
values so the editor can write changes back to the script. Behaviour is kept
deliberately faithful to the original, including quirks, so that scenes
previewed here behave the same in FlexDMD and in Visual Pinball.

src/flex/layout.ts descends from LibGDX's Scaling class (Copyright LibGDX
authors, Apache License 2.0), which FlexDMD adapted first.

The bitmap fonts and images under public/FlexDMD.Resources/ are redistributed
unmodified from FlexDMD's FlexDMD/Resources/.

FlexDMD itself is not affiliated with this project.
